"01:13.260" end="01:14.260">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.260" end="01:19.200"><span begin="01:14.260" end="01:14.510">If </span><span begin="01:14.510" end="01:14.700">its </span><span begin="01:14.700" end="01:19.200">true.(oooh)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.200" end="01:22.260"><span begin="01:19.200" end="01:19.380">I </span><span begin="01:19.380" end="01:19.560">never </span><span begin="01:19.560" end="01:19.760">thought </span><span begin="01:19.760" end="01:20.000">I</span><span begin="01:20.000" end="01:20.190">'</span><span begin="01:20.190" end="01:20.380">d </span><span begin="01:20.380" end="01:20.570">feel </span><span begin="01:20.570" end="01:20.760">this </span><span begin="01:20.760" end="01:20.990">kind </span><span begin="01:20.990" end="01:21.190">of </span><span begin="01:21.190" end="01:26.010">hesitation(tonight)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.010" end="01:32.940"><span begin="01:26.010" end="01:26.260">My </span><span begin="01:26.260" end="01:26.570">hand </span><span begin="01:26.570" end="01:26.880">on </span><span begin="01:26.880" end="01:27.320">another </span><span begin="01:27.320" end="01:32.940">girl(oooh)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.940" end="01:36.430"><span begin="01:32.940" end="01:33.120">I </span><span begin="01:33.120" end="01:33.380">wish </span><span begin="01:33.380" end="01:33.560">I </span><span begin="01:33.560" end="01:33.750">didn</span><span begin="01:33.750" end="01:34.120">'</span><span begin="01:34.120" end="01:34.310">t </span><span begin="01:34.310" end="01:34.550">have </span><span begin="01:34.550" end="01:34.990">to </span><span begin="01:34.990" end="01:38.950">lie</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.950" end="01:43.060"><span begin="01:38.950" end="01:39.200">I </span><span begin="01:39.200" end="01:39.390">wish </span><span begin="01:39.390" end="01:39.640">I </span><span begin="01:39.640" end="01:39.820">could </span><span begin="01:39.820" end="01:40.140">let </span><span begin="01:40.140" end="01:40.510">you </span><span begin="01:40.510" end="01:43.060">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.060" end="01:55.550"><span begin="01:43.060" end="01:43.440">Cause </span><span begin="01:43.440" end="01:43.690">I </span><span begin="01:43.690" end="01:43.880">love </span><span begin="01:43.880" end="01:49.540">you </span><span begin="01:49.540" end="01:49.790">and </span><span begin="01:49.790" end="01:50.100">I </span><span begin="01:50.100" end="01:51.970">need </span><span begin="01:51.970" end="01:55.550">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.550" end="02:02.830"><span begin="01:55.550" end="01:55.860">I </span><span begin="01:55.860" end="01:56.110">only </span><span begin="01:56.110" end="01:58.310">want </span><span begin="01:58.310" end="02:02.830">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.830" end="02:09.070"><span begin="02:02.830" end="02:03.010">And </span><span begin="02:03.010" end="02:03.210">nobody</span><span begin="02:03.210" end="02:03.450">'</span><span begin="02:03.450" end="02:04.080">s </span><span begin="02:04.080" end="02:04.520">going </span><span begin="02:04.520" end="02:04.700">to </span><span begin="02:04.700" end="02:04.890">know </span><span begin="02:04.890" end="02:05.150">if </span><span begin="02:05.150" end="02:05.890">it</span><span begin="02:05.890" end="02:06.130">'</span><span begin="02:06.130" end="02:06.520">s </span><span begin="02:06.520" end="02:09.070">true</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.070" end="02:09.640"><span begin="02:09.070" end="02:12.520">Valerie</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.520" end="02:21.010"><span begin="02:12.520" end="02:12.710">I </span><span begin="02:12.710" end="02:12.910">know </span><span begin="02:12.910" end="02:13.210">you </span><span begin="02:13.210" end="02:14.270">can </span><span begin="02:14.270" end="02:14.710">see </span><span begin="02:14.710" end="02:15.520">through </span><span begin="02:15.520" end="02:15.530">me </span><span begin="02:15.530" end="02:15.770">(I </span><span begin="02:15.770" end="02:15.960">know </span><span begin="02:15.960" end="02:16.210">you </span><span begin="02:16.210" end="02:16.580">can </span><span begin="02:16.580" end="02:18.830">see </span><span begin="02:18.830" end="02:19.080">through </span><span begin="02:19.080" end="02:19.580">my </span><span begin="02:19.580" end="02:21.010">lies)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.010" end="02:26.420"><span begin="02:21.010" end="02:22.080">Valerie </span><span begin="02:22.080" end="02:22.380">(oh </span><span begin="02:22.380" end="02:26.420">Valerie)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.420" end="02:34.580"><span begin="02:26.420" end="02:26.600">You </span><span begin="02:26.600" end="02:26.790">just </span><span begin="02:26.790" end="02:26.980">choose </span><span begin="02:26.980" end="02:27.470">to </span><span begin="02:27.470" end="02:27.910">never </span><span begin="02:27.910" end="02:29.600">know </span><span begin="02:29.600" end="02:29.850">(no </span><span begin="02:29.850" end="02:30.090">you </span><span begin="02:30.090" end="02:30.290">just </span><span begin="02:30.290" end="02:30.530">don</span><span begin="02:30.530" end="02:30.910">'</span><span begin="02:30.910" end="02:31.150">t </span><span begin="02:31.150" end="02:31.960">know  </span><span begin="02:31.960" end="02:32.160">what </span><span begin="02:32.160" end="02:32.400">I </span><span begin="02:32.400" end="02:33.150">do  </span><span begin="02:33.150" end="02:33.330">what </span><span begin="02:33.330" end="02:33.900">I </span><span begin="02:33.900" end="02:34.580">do)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.580" end="02:39.270"><span begin="02:34.580" end="02:39.270">Valerie</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.270" end="02:42.900"><span begin="02:39.270" end="02:39.450">Why </span><span begin="02:39.450" end="02:39.640">pretend </span><span begin="02:39.640" end="02:39.830">to </s