 begin="02:56.460" end="02:56.710">oh  </span><span begin="02:56.710" end="02:56.950">oh  </span><span begin="02:56.950" end="02:57.580">oh  </span><span begin="02:57.580" end="02:58.460">oh  </span><span begin="02:58.460" end="03:00.960">oh)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.960" end="03:07.630"><span begin="03:00.960" end="03:01.210">Cause </span><span begin="03:01.210" end="03:01.700">I </span><span begin="03:01.700" end="03:03.320">love </span><span begin="03:03.320" end="03:07.630">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.630" end="03:12.260"><span begin="03:07.630" end="03:07.870">And </span><span begin="03:07.870" end="03:08.190">I </span><span begin="03:08.190" end="03:09.810">need </span><span begin="03:09.810" end="03:13.810">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.810" end="03:27.840"><span begin="03:13.810" end="03:14.010">I </span><span begin="03:14.010" end="03:14.190">only </span><span begin="03:14.190" end="03:16.250">want </span><span begin="03:16.250" end="03:20.020">you </span><span begin="03:20.020" end="03:20.630">and </span><span begin="03:20.630" end="03:20.820">nobody</span><span begin="03:20.820" end="03:21.650">'</span><span begin="03:21.650" end="03:21.900">s </span><span begin="03:21.900" end="03:22.210">going </span><span begin="03:22.210" end="03:22.470">to </span><span begin="03:22.470" end="03:24.090">know </span><span begin="03:24.090" end="03:24.420">if </span><span begin="03:24.420" end="03:24.600">its </span><span begin="03:24.600" end="03:53.700">true</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:53.700" end="03:59.570"><span begin="03:53.700" end="03:53.940">And </span><span begin="03:53.940" end="03:54.380">I </span><span begin="03:54.380" end="03:54.690">love </span><span begin="03:54.690" end="03:56.700">you(cause </span><span begin="03:56.700" end="03:56.890">I </span><span begin="03:56.890" end="03:57.140">love </span><span begin="03:57.140" end="03:57.510">you </span><span begin="03:57.510" end="03:59.570">baby)</s